OL,3,GNEWSARare Salvador Dali lithograph
OL,4,Acollection to go under the hammer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA private art collection which includes
OL,7,Fmore than 30 hand-signed Salvador Dali
OL,8,Flithographs is to go up for auction.
OL,10,FThe images are being prepared for
OL,11,Fpublic display in Glasgow before going
OL,12,Funder the hammer on 24 November, when
OL,13,Fthey are expected to fetch as much as
OL,14,F#120,000.
OL,16,FEric Crombie, from Crombie's
OL,17,FAuctioneers, said the owner of the
OL,18,Fcollection had got in touch as he is
OL,19,Fmoving abroad and cannot take the
OL,20,Flithographs with him.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
