OL,3,GNEWSARare Salvador Dali lithograph
OL,4,Acollection to go under the hammer
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "Finding a single
OL,7,Fauthenticated, hand-signed Dali is
OL,8,Frare, but uncovering an entire private
OL,9,Fcollection of this scale is a major
OL,10,Fevent for the art world."
